pelt_args=-i -m
prompt_wait=5
tr_by=hand
why=sh37, pelt#114: PAX's shapes line, eight `true &` and a `wait` in an interactive job-control shell, prints its SHAPE line and a prompt comes back within 5 s, three times, then a hundred rounds of it in one line. The ended jobs are told of at the next prompt (standard error). Written by hand: dash -i -m agrees on standard output
